            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Action-oriented</h4>\n<p>We’re solution-first, delivering more than just ideas. From strategy to execution, our focus is on achieving measurable results &#8211; not just impressive presentations.</p>\n"
              },
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Insight, AI + technology</h4>\n<p>Innovation is in our DNA. From our <a href=\"https://www.o3world.com/1682-conference/\">1682 initiative</a> to expertise in <a href=\"https://www.o3world.com/solutions/ai-solutions/\">technology and AI</a>, we map out bold solutions and ensure they’re successfully brought to life.</p>\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Proven + tested</h4>\n<p>Our human-centered methodology, refined over a decade, turns journey insights into actionable and impactful strategies that drive results.</p>\n"
              },
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Industry-tailored strategies</h4>\n<p>We deliver solutions tailored for unique industry challenges, including health, insurance, finance, industrial services, and technology.</p>\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
